@format fwcollab.symbol_map.v3
@id V4-L4-002
@title constructive L4 full-mechanism curriculum 002; fixed-reflection orb light door
@max_steps 1
@controller c1_lever lever at 6,5
@actuator a1_platform platform at 2,9 controlled_by all(c1_lever)
@controller c2_plate plate at 3,14 accepts F
@actuator a2_platform platform at 7,18 controlled_by all(c2_plate)
@controller c3_plate plate at 6,23 accepts W
@actuator a3_door door at 2,27 controlled_by all(c3_plate)
@controller c4_toggle toggle at 3,32
@actuator a4_door door at 7,36 controlled_by all(c4_toggle)
@light + direction RIGHT sensor S opens A
